00:10:55,140 --> 00:10:56,943
to do the work you just described?

272
00:10:58,796 --> 00:11:01,230
- Yeah, I do use it.

273
00:11:01,230 --> 00:11:06,230
I use ChatGPT, and I am not afraid to say I do.

