00:11:26,137 --> 00:11:29,250
"Just don't, you know, when you ask a question,

281
00:11:29,250 --> 00:11:30,957
make sure you proof it."

282
00:11:31,800 --> 00:11:34,230
But as the more and more I've utilized it,

283
00:11:34,230 --> 00:11:37,380
it makes my job much more simpler.

284
00:11:37,380 --> 00:11:40,290
I've been working on several different MOUs,

285
00:11:40,290 --> 00:11:43,350
