00:16:00,480 --> 00:16:02,130
and they were talking about data security,

412
00:16:02,130 --> 00:16:03,360
I have no idea.

413
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:04,800
They're now like, "Go to Copilot."

414
00:16:04,800 --> 00:16:07,170
So that side, and I also watched a team,

415
00:16:07,170 --> 00:16:09,122
and this is really creative.

416
00:16:09,122 --> 00:16:11,940
They were a high-potential learning pro--

417
00:16:11,940 --> 00:16:13,650
high-potential group,

418
00:16:13,650 --> 00:16:15,761
and they were designing a product for market.

419
00:16:15,761 --> 00:16:19,770
They got by, "Here's the market we're looking at,

420
00:16:19,770 --> 00:16:21,750
here are the consumers we're looking at."

421
00:16:21,750 --> 00:16:26,100
It came up with the packaging ideas for these products,

422
00:16:26,100 --> 00:16:29,100
and it was amazing in what it did in like,

423
00:16:29,100 --> 00:16:30,540
and they were using ChatGPT,

424
00:16:30,540 --> 00:16:33,510
and it was amazing to see the designs

425
00:16:33,510 --> 00:16:34,590
